AGENTIC RAG

Traditional RAG:

Question
 ↓
Retrieve
 ↓
Answer

Agentic RAG:

Question
 ↓
Agent
 ↓
Decide what information is required
 ↓
Retrieve
 ↓
Evaluate results
 ↓
Retrieve again if needed
 ↓
Reason
 ↓
Answer
Example

User:

Compare the profitability of Company A and Company B.

Agent might:

Find Company A financial data
 ↓
Find Company B financial data
 ↓
Check whether data is complete
 ↓
Calculate margins
 ↓
Compare
 ↓
Generate conclusion

This is much more flexible than basic RAG.
